@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN
### 1. Listar los comercios de Ana
GET {{host}}/comercios
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Consultar el comercio 1
GET {{host}}/comercios/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Consultar el usuario autenticado
GET {{host}}/user
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Listar transacciones
GET {{host}}/transacciones
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Filtrar transacciones completadas
GET {{host}}/transacciones?estado=Completada
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### 6. Consultar la transacción 2
GET {{host}}/transacciones/2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Crear una transacción de prueba
POST {{host}}/transacciones
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "comercio_id": 1,
    "monto": 12.50,
    "cliente_nombre": "Cliente API Prueba",
    "estado": "Iniciada"
}

### 8. Probar validación de datos inválidos
POST {{host}}/transacciones
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "comercio_id": 1,
    "monto": -5,
    "cliente_nombre": "Prueba de validación",
    "estado": "Iniciada"
}

### 9. Eliminar la transacción de prueba
DELETE {{host}}/transacciones/7
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
